<title>USA: Boise City, Idaho, repriced, yields 5.290 pct.</title>
<headline>Boise City, Idaho, repriced, yields 5.290 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seattle-Northwest Securities Corp said it repriced $1.445 million of Boise City, Idaho, certiifcates of participation, series 1997A, with a top yield of 5.20 percent in 2006.</p>
